+This independent root proposes one account-wide **USD 200 before-credit** cost budget with actual-spend alerts above 50%, 80% and 100% (USD 100/160/200). This root has never been applied; dated planning status and results are retained in [the billing-plan evidence](../../../docs/agent-runs/phase-12/evidence/12d-billing-plan/). `enable_budget` is false by default. Changing it is configuration, not approval to apply. Standard notifications are monitoring; they do not stop resources or impose a dollar cap.
 
